<xmi:XMI xmlns:PlayIDE="http://eija.studio/profiles/actors/1" xmlns:uml="http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20161101" xmlns:xmi="http://www.omg.org/spec/XMI/20131001">
  <uml:Model xmi:id="model.ai-ops" name="AI ops deploys">
    <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="model.ai-ops.comment">
      <body>An AI ops agent opens a change and asks CI to build it; the CI server reports green or red; a person on call signs the deploy off; the deploy window (a timer) starts the rollout; the health monitor confirms it or rolls it back. Machines may roll back on their own, but only a person sends a change toward production (ADR-0210).</body>
    </ownedComment>
    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:DataType" xmi:id="type.Date" name="Date" />
